xpected to read before Chapter 1.","position":{"start":{"line":109,"column":1},"end":{"line":109,"column":1}},"key":"JtjKjNY5Li"}],"key":"eojuUi0Tsp"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":117,"column":1},"end":{"line":122,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"For a first reading, work through the derivations and trace the small\nexamples before running the longer companions. For a practical reading,\nkeep the repository beside the book and compare the named intermediate\nresults, not just the last printed energy. A successful execution tells\nyou that a program ran; the physical sector, matrix ordering and energy\nconvention tell you what its result means.","position":{"start":{"line":117,"column":1},"end":{"line":117,"column":1}},"key":"nyUhAp4txe"}],"key":"cLCg0O1p4c"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":124,"column":1},"end":{"line":130,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Exercises range from a hand calculation to a bounded programming task.\nTry the calculation first, then use the companion to inspect the result.\n","position":{"start":{"line":124,"column":1},"end":{"line":124,"column":1}},"key":"HZDLHSv4Ho"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":124,"column":1},"end":{"line":124,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Selected Worked Solutions","position":{"start":{"line":124,"column":1},"end":{"line":124,"column":1}},"key":"vLoAAcqlKq"}],"key":"SmdSwjp2a9"},{"type":"text","value":" gives reasoning for selected questions,\nidentified by chapter title and exercise name rather than just a number.\nIt is not a complete instructor answer key. An open-ended investigation\ndoes not acquire a unique answer merely because it appears at the end\nof a chapter.","position":{"start":{"line":124,"column":1},"end":{"line":124,"column":1}},"key":"xzVsvoprhN"}],"key":"toCq4hKEFQ"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":132,"column":1},"end":{"line":132,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value